# API origin (no trailing slash, no /api/v1 suffix); the portal calls ${VITE_API_BASE}/api/v1.
# Leave EMPTY to use the same origin:
#   - development: Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:3000 (vite.config.ts)
#   - Vercel: vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the Render backend, so no CORS setup is needed
#   - Docker: nginx.conf proxies /api to the api service
# Only set it (e.g. https://tms-yl0r.onrender.com) when the browser should call the backend directly; the
# backend's CORS_ORIGINS must then include this site's origin (e.g. https://your-portal.vercel.app).
VITE_API_BASE=
# Optional MapLibre style URL for a licensed basemap. Without it, maps show area boundaries on a plain background.
VITE_MAP_STYLE_URL=
